      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشِمٌّ</span></b>  [<i>Turning away,</i> or <i>averse</i>]. One says,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرَضْتُ عَلَيْهِ كَذَا فَإِذَا هُوَ مُشِمٌّ لَا يُرِيدُهُ</span> [<i>I offered
to him such a thing, and lo, he was averse, not
desiring it</i>]. (S.)

